          3 INFO       Bootstrap enrolment window                                                                                                                                                                               Authn.MfaEnrolmentWindowSeconds is 900 second(s). A sign-in refused with E-50109 or E-50107 may enrol a FIRST factor for that long, and nothing else -- a confirmed factor is never replaceable by this route.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
          3 INFO       Policy rows available to resolve                                                                                                                                                                         None. Expected, and not a problem: most tenants have no policy row and a small deployment may have none at all. auth.udfResolveAuthPolicy returns NULL and the sign-in path falls back to the Authn.* defaults in config.ApplicationSetting -- section 7.2.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          3 INFO       The three predicates are in the REFERENCE form                                                                                                                                                           They join auth.Permission and test PermissionCode, which is one seek per row more than section 10.2 allows. 120_rls_policy.sql re-creates them with the permission ids as literals and asserts the list still matches (T-065). Re-running THIS file alone reverts them to the slower form, which is correct and slower -- never permissive -- and re-running 120 restores the fast form. That trade is why this file does not ship a deny-everything placeholder: a deployment that forgot one script would otherwise black out a live database.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
          4 OK         Function auth.udfIsTenantUsable                                                                                                                                                                          Section 5.4. The single definition of tenant usability, read by the session procedures, the tenant procedures and the row-level security predicate.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
          4 OK         auth.udfIsTenantUsable fails closed on an absent tenant                                                                                                                                                  Called with -1, which cannot be a TenantId. Anything but 0 means the function has stopped requiring the depth-0 self row, and every usability check in the database has quietly become permissive.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      
          4 OK         auth.udfIsTenantUsable fails closed on NULL                                                                                                                                                              A caller comparing the result to 0 must get its refusal rather than an unevaluated branch.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          4 OK         Function auth.udfIsUserUsable                                                                                                                                                                            Section 6.3. The single copy of the effective-lockout expression, promised by 040_auth_userprofile.sql.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
          4 OK         auth.udfIsUserUsable fails closed on an absent user and on NULL                                                                                                                                          Called with -1, which cannot be a UserId, and with NULL. Anything but 0 from either means the function has stopped requiring the row to exist, and every usability check on the sign-in path has quietly become permissive -- which is a failure nobody notices, because what happens is that a sign-in succeeds.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
          4 OK         Function auth.udfResolveAuthPolicy                                                                                                                                                                       Section 7.2, task T-032. Returns the identifier of the nearest live policy at or above a tenant, or NULL.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
          4 OK         auth.udfResolveAuthPolicy returns NULL for a tenant that cannot exist                                                                                                                                    Called with -1. An identifier here would be an identifier pointing at no row, and a caller that did not check would read zero columns and treat them as false -- disabling local password sign-in for the whole estate.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
          4 OK         Function auth.udfResolveSessionUser                                                                                                                                                                      Section 6.4, task T-041. The single definition of session liveness for callers that need the user id -- all four conditions in one place, because 112_auth_mfa_procedures.sql asks the question three times.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
          4 OK         auth.udfResolveSessionUser fails closed on an unissued hash and on NULL                                                                                                                                  Called with 0x00, which is not 32 bytes and so cannot be a stored hash, and with NULL. A UserId from either means the liveness test has stopped requiring the row to match, and every actor check in 112_auth_mfa_procedures.sql accepts a forged session -- a failure whose symptom is that enrolment WORKS.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
          4 OK         Function auth.udfResolveEnrolmentActor                                                                                                                                                                   Section 6.4, task T-041. The bootstrap half of "who is asking": which just-refused exchange may enrol a first factor. Without it, a user under a policy requiring MFA and holding no factor can never sign in.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
          4 OK         auth.udfResolveEnrolmentActor fails closed on an impossible exchange and on NULL                                                                                                                         Called with -1, which cannot be a LoginAttemptId, and with NULL. A UserId from either means the one route in this database that acts without a live session has stopped checking which exchange it was handed.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
          4 OK         Function auth.udfHasPermission                                                                                                                                                                           Section 9.1, task T-050. "Does the active profile hold permission P at tenant T?" -- what auth.uspDemandPermission asks before it raises E-50030.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
          4 OK         Function auth.tvfPermissionScope                                                                                                                                                                         Section 9.1, task T-051. "Which tenants does the active profile hold permission P on?" -- the tenant picker and the report aggregation.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
          4 OK         Function auth.tvfTenantReadPredicate                                                                                                                                                                     Section 10.2, task T-061. The FILTER predicate: SELECT, UPDATE and DELETE. In the reference form that tests PermissionCode; 120_rls_policy.sql re-creates it with the ids as literals.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
          4 OK         Function auth.tvfTenantInsertPredicate                                                                                                                                                                   Section 10.3, task T-062. BLOCK AFTER INSERT, and the anchored half of P-06 -- the row's tenant must EQUAL ActingTenantId, not merely be within reach.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
          4 OK         Function auth.tvfTenantUpdatePredicate                                                                                                                                                                   Section 10.3, task T-063. Bound twice, BEFORE and AFTER UPDATE, so a row can be neither edited nor moved outside the profile's write authority.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
          4 OK         The three RLS predicates are WITH SCHEMABINDING                                                                                                                                                          3 of 3 are schema-bound. A policy binds nothing else, so anything but 3 means 120_rls_policy.sql will fail -- and until it does, the tables it should have protected are not.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
          4 OK         All five authorization functions fail closed with no session context                                                                                                                                     This connection has called no auth.uspSetSessionContext, so SESSION_CONTEXT ('UserProfileId') is NULL and every one of these must refuse. A 1 from auth.udfHasPermission, or a row from any of the three predicates, means an unauthenticated connection has authority over tenant 1 -- and for the FILTER predicate it means every protected table is readable by anybody who can open a connection.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
          4 OK         Data.Read, Data.Insert and Data.Update exist for every live application                                                                                                                                  All three permissions the RLS predicates test are present for every live application, so 120_rls_policy.sql has ids to resolve.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         


