          4 OK         The refused bypass set no session key                                                                                                                                                                    SESSION_CONTEXT (N'BypassRowSecurity') must still be NULL on this connection. Session context is not transactional, so a key set before a refusal would survive the rollback that follows it -- which is exactly why that procedure sets the key AFTER its COMMIT and not inside its work block.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
          4 OK         The refusals reached logs.ExecutionLog                                                                                                                                                                   3 failed row(s) recorded by the probes above in the last five minutes; three are expected. Rule 8 is not decoration: there is no separate error table -- logs.uspRecordExecutionError writes the error columns of logs.ExecutionLog, and for an error-only procedure that row is the ONLY evidence a request was refused and why. Two of these three rows have no start row before them, which is the orphan shape @ContextMessage exists to explain to whoever reads them.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
          4 OK         MS_Description on the session procedures                                                                                                                                                                 4 of 4 procedures carry a description. Conventions rule 4.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              
          4 OK         EXECUTE granted to applicationRole                                                                                                                                                                       2 of 2. uspSetSessionContext and uspClearSessionContext. The application reaches session context through these two and through nothing else -- INV-11.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
          4 OK         EXECUTE granted to rlsBypassRole                                                                                                                                                                         2 of 2. uspBeginMaintenanceSession and uspEndMaintenanceSession, and NOT applicationRole: an application one EXEC away from reading every tenant is what section 21 exists to prevent.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
